 ],
 "balloons": [
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "They will come.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Not with drums, this time. With papers.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "SENIOR ENVOY"
   ],
   "text": "<Captain De Lannoy.>",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "SENIOR ENVOY"
   ],
   "text": "<We were told...>",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "<You were told many things.>",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "<Some of them were true.>",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "SENIOR ENVOY"
   ],
   "text": "The Honourable Company conveys its formal regrets for the unfortunate conflict at Colachel.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Regrets.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "You regret that your men died when they tried to land on my shore.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Do you regret sending them here at all?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "SENIOR ENVOY"
   ],
   "text": "Circumstances were misjudged. We underestimated the strength and resolve of Travancore.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "SENIOR ENVOY"
   ],
   "text": "We have been instructed to correct this error.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN (off)"
   ],
   "text": "By whose instruction?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "SENIOR ENVOY"
   ],
   "text": "The Governor General and Council at Batavia.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "So far from this coast.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Yet their decisions wash up here like driftwood.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 4,
   "speakers": [
    "SENIOR ENVOY"
   ],
   "text": "The Company proposes a treaty.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Read.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Who decides who is a pirate?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "In Velinadu, when we killed company men who broke their word, you called us pirates.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DUTCH SCRIBE (off)"
   ],
   "text": "...friendship and alliance, in the event of encroachment by any other European power.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "You would like us to fight your rivals at your side.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "SENIOR ENVOY"
   ],
   "text": "We prefer to be your trading partners rather than your enemies.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Partners.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 4,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Partners who once tried to break my spine.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "And what do you offer for the men who died at Colachel and in Velinadu,",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "and in the smaller towns your patrols burned?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "SENIOR ENVOY"
   ],
   "text": "We cannot bring back the dead.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "SENIOR ENVOY"
   ],
   "text": "We can only ensure that more do not die in similar misunderstandings.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI (off, small lettering)"
   ],
   "text": "Misunderstandings. A pretty word for greed.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "SENIOR ENVOY"
   ],
   "text": "Not all houses on this coast share the Maharaja's... enthusiasm for consolidation.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "SENIOR ENVOY"
   ],
   "text": "There are those who remember older arrangements. Older claims.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "SENIOR ENVOY"
   ],
   "text": "If the company wished, we could simply wait. Support those who feel aggrieved. Let internal divisions do what external force could not.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "You will find the cost higher than you expect.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "SENIOR ENVOY"
   ],
   "text": "Perhaps. We have learned patience.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "You have learned that your guns cannot keep us from killing your men.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "nagoji",
    "revathi",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "You have learned that some of our houses, like Velinadu and Padmini's line, will not sign papers that erase their names.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "nagoji",
    "revathi",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "So you bring different papers. Clever.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "nagoji",
    "revathi",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "I approve of cleverness. It makes life interesting.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Do not mistake my approval for weakness.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "We will not sign away our children's choices.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "If you wish pepper, you will pay.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "If you wish warriors, you will not have them. This army is not for hire.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "As for Captain De Lannoy, he is now my officer. He will not return to your service.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "SENIOR ENVOY"
   ],
   "text": "We had hoped he might be returned as part of an exchange...",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA (off)"
   ],
   "text": "You had hoped many things.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA (off)"
   ],
   "text": "Hopes are not terms.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "If you wish to send him letters, we will read them first.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "eustachius",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "If they instruct him to betray his new oath, we will burn them without troubling him.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "eustachius",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "SENIOR ENVOY"
   ],
   "text": "May we sign the articles on trade and recognition?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "We will draft our own version. Your paper will be weighed against it. When both sides match, we will sign.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "SENIOR ENVOY"
   ],
   "text": "How long will this take?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "As long as needed. We have learned to be patient.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "We will sign this truce at Mannar now.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "But the real treaty, the one where you promise never to stand in our way again, will come at Mavelikkara, when we are finished with the north.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "SENIOR ENVOY"
   ],
   "text": "<You have chosen the wrong side. The company does not forget those who betray it.>",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "<It forgets those who die for it.>",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "<I prefer to be remembered by someone closer than Amsterdam.>",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "SENIOR ENVOY"
   ],
   "text": "<They call you traitor in Batavia.>",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "<Here, they call me kapitan. That is enough.>",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dutch_envoys",
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Satisfied?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "They bowed. That is something.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "But I have seen enough paper to know that men who sign today can tear tomorrow.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "Ram will keep copies.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-02",
   "balloon": 4,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Paper burns. Land remembers.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Today, my son, we have made them pay to do what they once did for free. That is a small victory.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Small victories add up.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "So do small betrayals.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Remember this, Nagoji. You are of this house now.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Few will talk of the quiet days after Colachel, when men in coats tried to rebuild their power with ink. Those days matter too.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I will remember.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Good. Because one day, when you are old and some young rider asks you how we kept this coast from becoming another Goa, you must tell him about both.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "The charge and the papers. The dead on the sand and the men who bowed here today.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "GUARD"
   ],
   "text": "Ramayyan requests you.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "GUARD"
   ],
   "text": "Now.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Dutch?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Not Dutch. North.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "My cousins trade in Maratha ports. Pune has heard of Colachel.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "Some say a kingdom that can break a company square might one day threaten Maratha borders.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "Others say it might make a useful ally against the English.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "And which way does the wind blow?",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "The wind blows in circles. It carries your name north and the Peshwa's name south.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "Somewhere in the middle, men are deciding whether those names should be written in treaties or in obituaries.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You trust him?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "I trust his web. Every strand vibrates when something moves. If he lies to me, another strand will tell me.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "When the first letter comes, bring it to me.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  }
 ]
}